    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000ril5](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000ril5) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 31.021 depth occurred on Oct 22 2025 8km S of Quepos. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 9.3653 longitude -84.1795. It impacted 120528 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
